@startuml ibd_ecu
title Internal block diagram - ECU_LightingCtrl, ports and signal flows (MagicGrid, Structure)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "ECU_LightingCtrl" {
  component "MCU_Lockstep" as MCU
  component "ASIC_Watchdog" as WD
  component "Power_Supply_Unit" as PSU
  component "LED_Driver_Stage_1..n" as DRV
  component "Current_Sense_Chain" as CS
  component "Temp_Sense_Chain" as TS
  portin " " as pKL30
  portin " " as pCANin
  portout " " as pCANout
  portout " " as pCH
}

pKL30 --> PSU : KL30 / KL15, 16-32 V
pCANin --> MCU : LightRequest, VehicleSpeed,\nSteeringAngle, AmbientLight, ObjectList
MCU --> pCANout : LightingStatus, DriverWarningReq
MCU --> DRV : PWM_Ch1..n (400 Hz), Enable_Ch1..n
WD --> DRV : WD_Disable (TSR-001)
MCU <--> WD : question / answer
DRV --> CS : shunt voltage
CS --> MCU : I_Load_Ch1..n (12 bit, PWM-synchronous)
DRV --> MCU : U_Channel_Ch1..n, DriverStatus_Ch1..n
TS --> MCU : T_LED, T_Board
DRV --> pCH : channel current to the headlamp modules
PSU --> MCU : 5 V / 3.3 V
PSU --> DRV : supply

note bottom
  Signals, ranges, cycle times and ASIL per signal:
  04_architecture/ee_architecture.md, interface table.
end note
@enduml
